    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu kuwikaba wamaiza wake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Choonyi, inyo mbari ra wandu, mpate kusikira; deghenyi madu inyo wandu wa ndoenyi msikire, ee, wurumwengu na vose viko andenyi yaro choonyi msikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wabonya machu aighu ya mbari rose ra wandu na aighu ya majeshi ghawo ghose; nao wawitanyire wipate kubwaghwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gharia rawo nderichaarikwa, naro richawoa na kunuka; mighondi yose ichachulwa ni bagha rawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majeshi ghose gha mlungunyi ghichasagha, na mawingunyi kuchakuchwa sa karatasi. Majeshi gharo ghose ghichapotoka sa malemba gha mizabibu na gha mtini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
